  "notes": "The official TV anime character page groups named characters by their school team and explicitly lists the entire exact campaign roster: Seirin lists Aida Riko, Kagami Taiga, and Kuroko Tetsuya; Kaijo lists Kasamatsu Yukio and Kise Ryouta; Shutoku lists Midorima Shintarou and Takao Kazunari; Touou lists Aomine Daiki and Momoi Satsuki; Yosen lists Himuro Tatsuya and Murasakibara Atsushi; Rakuzan lists Akashi Seijuurou (https://tv.kurobas.com/character/). The page carries the production copyright notice (C) Fujimaki Tadatoshi / Shueisha / Kuroko's Basketball Production Committee. Each relation is an exact campaign character directly named on the official franchise character roster."
